flowchart LR
  A([TESL email received]) --> B[Match mailbox, folder,<br/>sender and subject]
  B --> C{TESL email?}
  C -- No --> Z0([Ignore])
  C -- Yes --> D[Parse configured aliases]
  D --> E[Validate TESL details]
  E --> F{Valid?}
  F -- No --> G[Preserve source and alert owner] --> Z1([Validation failure])
  F -- Yes --> H[Resolve approver and delegation]
  H --> I[Create immutable submission]
  I --> AI[Optional advisory AI review<br/>extract / summarize / flag]
  AI --> AIP[Persist assessment<br/>human decision required]
  AIP --> J[Create Teams approval<br/>email disabled]
  J --> K{Decision}
  K -- Approve/Reject --> N[Persist decision and audit]
  K -- Urgent delegate --> L[Record verbal delegation] --> N
  K -- 14-day timeout --> M[Cancel primary and create EDMS approval]
  M --> N
  N --> O[Teams/SharePoint status<br/>owner-only summary]
  O --> P[Approved desktop boundary<br/>future intranet execution]
  P --> Z2([Complete])
